# broom-assets.zip (web UI, iPXE, scripts) this binary belongs to (assets.rs): its sha256, then its URL.
# CI does not write it here: it builds the release binary with the `external-assets` feature (those files not inside)
# and appends its pins to it ("#broom-pins" trailer, assets.rs pin()). Comments only (as committed) = a local build:
# the assets are embedded.
